  "2026-10-25T15:07:21.641Z","harness:codex","Graph remediation uses existing justified co-delivery and runner-validation relationships; the prose-gap measurement is back within its unchanged ceiling. Corrected only my own misplaced advisory comments through pm, preserving original texts in immutable history. Linked regressions and record-integrity pass. The bounded SDK mutation partition passes345/352 killed with7 classified equivalents and no uncovered mutants; this is not whole-SDK mutation proof. The first hosted head fails the same known graph gap and its source checks/reviews are still being collected. Sourcery is quota-limited and Greptile trial-limited; no unavailable provider is counted as approval."
  "2026-10-25T15:09:02.922Z","harness:codex","CodeRabbit completed its first full review and raised two valid reminder findings. Updated the standing release check to the verified October25 publication outcome and re-armed its existing one-shot reminder for October26 at06:00UTC with matching expected evidence. The standing item remains open and its canonical ownership is preserved. Source coverage and Codecov patch checks pass on the first hosted head; the only required failure is the already repaired graph-evidence gap."
